  "description": "A series of twenty-nine real-time sculptures that turn the same time series into different spatial forms: massif, tree, network, cascade, braid, orbit, arches, city and others. Each piece is built in the browser with WebGL from point clouds, lines and shaders, and can be rotated, scrubbed through time and switched between three time horizons.",
